<title>GERMANY: German Aug vehicle output unch yr/yr, exports down.</title>
<headline>German Aug vehicle output unch yr/yr, exports down.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German motor vehicle production stagnated at 280,100 vehicles in August, unchanged from the year-earlier level, the German Automobile Industry Association VDA said on Tuesday. Exports fell by six percent to 140,100 vehicles, the VDA said. It provided the following data.</p>
<p>PRODUCTION</p>
<p>				     Aug 96	    Change vs Aug 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles/vans  258,400		+2 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes    15,700		 +7 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks		 6,000		  -43 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles		 280,100		unch</p>
<p>EXPORTS</p>
<p>				     Aug 96	    Change vs Aug 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles/vans  126,200	   -6 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes    10,400	    +28 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks		 3,500	     -37 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles		 140,100	   -6 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
